      "before": "Disclaimer: Slight colour variations are possible due\nto photographic lighting or your monitor settings.\nProduct Details:\nExhibit a vibe of elegance with this classic three-piece suit from Kora.\nThe set comes with a royal cobalt blue embellished blazer, contrast white shirt and a black waist coat along with a classic black trouser, that is fashioned from premium quality material and is tailored for a slim fit.\nThe blazer is tailored to perfection in terry rayon fabric.\nThe abstract stripped embroidery in sequin and cutdana add charm to the blazer.\nThe lapel is tailored in contrast black blended fabric for a classy look.\nThe set comes with a black terry rayon waist coat.\nThe white shirt featuring is a timeless one which can never go wrong for a cocktail event.\nThe set comes with a solid black trouser tailored in straight fit crafted in terry rayon fabric.\nThe tuxedo looks great with a embellished band with a bow.\nAccessorize the outfit with black suede shoes.",
